5,1,1,talk,Servas,,I worry about the reporting burden. What does a new holding add to our quarter-end close?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to verify if our past wins actually held their customers. The stories feel inflated.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,We are bleeding cash. I need to know what follow-on calls will demand from our reserves.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,We spend too much time sourcing people. I want to see who recruiters can actually place now.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Past deals failed due to external delays. I need to know what kind of obstacle we are signing up for.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, if reserves are tight, we must avoid assets that require heavy external appraisal.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, external delays are common. I care more about whether the product sticks after launch.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Servas, agreed. I will look at the credit line terms to see what we can borrow against.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, retention is key, but if we can't staff the rollout, retention is moot.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, staffing is a symptom. I need to see the delivery records to understand the root cause.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"I will check the appraisal needs. If it adds six weeks, it breaks our reporting cycle.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"I will look at account retention. If they lose customers on price hikes, the model is weak.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will check the reserve accounts. I need to see the actual call rates versus the model.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will check the recruiter placement times. I need to know if we can fill shift supervisors quickly.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I will check the security review time. If it takes three quarters, we are dead on arrival.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
