35,2,1,talk,Servas,,The appraisal data is alarming. Hardware adds six weeks to our audit. We must avoid that.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Asuka,,Retention data is clear. The practice and field sensor tools kept customers. The shop tool lost a third.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minako,,The credit line is useless for subscriptions. It only values stock. We cannot borrow against software.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,Recruiters can't place field crews or supervisors in under four months. That is a dealbreaker for ops-heavy models.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Security review took three quarters for medical and financial data. One quarter for the rest. That is the key.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Toshio, if security review is the bottleneck, we should avoid anything touching sensitive data.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, if we can't borrow against subscriptions, we need cash-flow positive models from day one.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, exactly. The reserve calls are double the model. We need low-maintenance assets.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Servas, I agree. If we can't staff the field, we shouldn't pick a field sensor company.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, the delivery records show the bank tool never missed a release. The device maker lost five months.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,The independent checks show field sensors and goods moving are verifiable. Software is a black box.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The exits were quiet back-office tools. The write-off ran its own premises. We should avoid premises.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minako,,The credit line terms confirm we need assets with tangible stock or simple cash flow.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,"The adviser bench has logistics experts, but they haven't taken anything. We are short on ops help.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The security review time is the differentiator. Medical and financial data are too slow.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
