60,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Candidates are A, B, C, D. A is medical, B is field sensors, C is apparel, D is financial software.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"A and D touch sensitive data. B and C are physical. B has good retention, C has bad.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minako,,"B has stock, which the credit line values. C has stock too, but retention is poor.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Mio,,"B needs field crews, which we can't place. C needs shift supervisors, which we also can't place.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,A and D have long security reviews. B and C are faster. But B's delivery was risky.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Toshio, B's delivery risk is high, but the data is verifiable. D is a black box.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, B's retention is strong. C's is weak. I lean towards B despite the staffing issue.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, B's stock is borrowable. C's stock is too, but the customer churn is a risk.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Servas, I am worried about B's staffing. But C's churn is worse. Maybe D is safer?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, D's security review is three quarters. That is too long. B is one quarter.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Servas,,B is verifiable and has good retention. The staffing issue is manageable with our advisers.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Asuka,,B kept nine of ten accounts. That is the strongest signal. I vote B.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minako,,B's stock is valuable for our credit line. The follow-on calls are lower for hardware.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Mio,,I am still worried about the field crews. But C is worse. I will vote B.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"B's security review is one quarter. That is acceptable. The delivery risk is noted, but manageable.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
